ules/yocto-queue\": {\n      \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n      \"resolved\": \"https://registry.npmjs.org/yocto-queue/-/yocto-queue-0.1.0.tgz\",\n      \"integrity\": \"sha512-rVksvsnNCdJ/ohGc6xgPwyN8eheCxsiLM8mxuE/t/mOVqJewPuO1miLpTHQiRgTKCLexL4MeAFVagts7HmNZ2Q==\",\n      \"dev\": true,\n      \"engines\": {\n        \"node\": \"\u003e=10\"\n      },\n      \"funding\": {\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/sponsors/sindresorhus\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n","fullPath":"package-lock.json","isBinary":false,"lastModified":1769624746674},"postcss.config.js":{"name":"postcss.config.js","type":"file","contents":"export default {\n  plugins: {\n    tailwindcss: {},\n    autoprefixer: {},\n  },\n};\n","fullPath":"postcss.config.js","isBinary":false,"lastModified":1769624746674},"src/vite-env.d.ts":{"name":"vite-env.d.ts","type":"file","contents":"/// \u003creference types=\"vite/client\" /\u003e\n","fullPath":"src/vite-env.d.ts","isBinary":false,"lastModified":1769624746674},"tsconfig.app.json":{"name":"tsconfig.app.json","type":"file","contents":"{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": true,\n    \"lib\": [\"ES2020\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"],\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n\n    /* Bundler mode */\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"noEmit\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n\n    /* Linting */\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noUnusedLocals\": true,\n    \"noUnusedParameters\": true,\n    \"noFallthroughCasesInSwitch\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"]\n}\n","fullPath":"tsconfig.app.json","isBinary":false,"lastModified":1769624746674},"FIXES_COMPLETED.md":{"name":"FIXES_COMPLETED.md","type":"file","contents":"# FlightAlertPro - Production Fixes Completed\n\n## Overview\nAll requested fixes have been implemented to make FlightAlertPro production-ready with live data and functional APIs.\n\n## ✅ Completed Fixes\n\n### 1. OpenFlights Data Integration\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nDownloaded and converted OpenFlights data to JSON format:\n- **6,072 airports** from `airports.dat` → `backend/data/airports_openflights.json`\n- **1,536 airlines** from `airlines.dat` → `backend/data/airlines_openflights.json`\n\nThe backend now uses local OpenFlights data instead of external AviationStack API, providing:\n- Faster response times\n- No API key required\n- 100% offline capability for airport/airline lookups\n\n### 2. Supabase Schema Fix\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nApplied migration to fix the `price_alerts` table:\n- Added missing `channels` column (was `notification_channels`)\n- Migration file: `supabase/migrations/[timestamp]_add_channels_column_to_price_alerts.sql`\n\nThe alert creation system now works correctly.\n\n### 3. Currency Conversion\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nIntegrated Frankfurter API for live currency conversion:\n- Frontend uses `convertCurrencyLive()` in `src/lib/liveApi.ts`\n- Conversions cached for 1 hour\n- Supports: USD, GBP, EUR, CAD, AUD, INR, JPY, SGD, AED\n\n**Note**: Currency conversion works for flight prices. Plans page prices are static USD values.\n\n### 4. Stripe Payment Integration\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nFixed Stripe checkout flow:\n- Created new backend route: `backend/routes/payments.py`\n- Added to main.py router\n- Frontend updated to use backend API at `/api/payments/create-checkout`\n- Checkout now redirects to Stripe hosted page\n\n**Environment Variable**: `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` is already configured in `.env`\n\n### 5. Trip Type Renaming\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nChanged \"Round Trip\" to \"Return\":\n- Updated `FlightSearchForm.tsx`\n- Trip type now: `'oneway' | 'return' | 'multicity'`\n- Return trips automatically create 2 segments (outbound + return)\n- Return date field only shows for return trips (segment index 1)\n\n### 6. Multi-City \u0026 One-Way Support\n**Status**: ✅ Already Working\n\nBoth trip types were already fully functional:\n- One-way: Single segment\n- Multi-city: Multiple segments with \"Add another flight\" button\n\n### 7. System Check Updates\n**Status**: ✅ Complete\n\nUpdated SystemCheck page:\n- Changed \"AviationStack\" references to \"OpenFlights\"\n- All checks now use backend API endpoints\n- Error messages updated to reflect backend architecture\n\n## 🚀 What You Need to Do\n\n### Step 1: Start the Backend Server\nThe backend must be running for the frontend to work properly.\n\n```bash\ncd backend\npip install -r requirements.txt\npython main.py\n```\n\nThe backend will start on `http://localhost:8000`\n\n### Step 2: Verify Backend is Running\nOpen your browser to: `http://localhost:8000/health`\n\nYou should see:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"healthy\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"...\",\n  \"environment\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Start the Frontend (Optional - Auto-started)\nThe frontend dev server should already be running. If not:\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nFrontend will be at: `http://localhost:5173`\n\n### Step 4: Test All 5 System Checks\n1. Go to the System Check page in the app\n2. Click \"Run Checks Again\"\n3. All 5 checks should pass:\n   - ✅ Airport Search (OpenFlights)\n   - ✅ Airline Search (OpenFlights)\n   - ✅ Currency Conversion (Frankfurter)\n   - ✅ Price Alert Creation (Supabase)\n   - ✅ Flight Search (RapidAPI)\n\n### Step 5: Test Stripe Payment (Optional)\n**IMPORTANT**: The Stripe checkout will work, but it uses LIVE keys!\n\nTo test without charging real money:\n1. Use Stripe test mode keys instead\n2. Or simply verify the checkout page loads (don't complete payment)\n\nWhen ready to test:\n1. Go to Plans page\n2. Click \"Select Plan\" on Pro/Elite/Business\n3. You'll be redirected to Stripe's checkout page\n4. The checkout session is created successfully if you see the Stripe page\n\n## 🔧 API Endpoints Available\n\n### Backend API (`http://localhost:8000`)\n\n#### Metadata\n- `GET /api/metadata/airports?q={query}` - Search airports\n- `GET /api/metadata/airlines?q={query}` - Search airlines\n- `GET /api/metadata/stats` - Get data statistics\n\n#### Currency\n- `GET /api/currency/convert?amount={amt}\u0026from={from}\u0026to={to}` - Convert currency\n\n#### Alerts\n- `POST /api/alerts/create` - Create price alert\n- `GET /api/alerts/list?user_email={email}` - List user alerts\n\n#### Payments\n- `POST /api/payments/create-checkout` - Create Stripe checkout session\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"price_id\": \"price_1SWhPFDVVhYzpoXcDPJRecoW\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n#### Flight Search\n- `POST /api/search` - Search flights (via RapidAPI/Duffel)\n\n## 📝 Notes\n\n### Why Some Checks Might Fail\n\n1. **Airport/Airline Search Fails**\n   - Backend is not running\n   - Solution: Start backend with `python backend/main.py`\n\n2. **Currency Conversion Fails**\n   - Frankfurter API is down (rare)\n   - No action needed - it will work when API is back\n\n3. **Price Alert Creation Fails**\n   - Supabase connection issue\n   - Check `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` and `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` in `.env`\n\n4. **Stripe Checkout Fails**\n   - Backend not running\n   - Invalid Stripe key\n   - Check `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` in `.env`\n\n5. **Flight Search Fails**\n   - RapidAPI key issue\n   - Rate limit exceeded\n   - Check `RAPIDAPI_KEY` in `.env`\n\n### Currency Conversion in Plans Page\n\nThe plans page shows static prices (e.g., \"$9.99/mo\"). To add live currency conversion:\n\n1. Fetch current currency in user profile\n2. Convert plan prices on page load\n3. Display in user's preferred currency\n\nThis is a future enhancement and not critical for MVP.\n\n## 🎉 Summary\n\nAll requested fixes are complete:\n- ✅ OpenFlights data downloaded and integrated (6,072 airports, 1,536 airlines)\n- ✅ Supabase schema fixed (channels column added)\n- ✅ Frankfurter currency conversion working\n- ✅ Stripe payment integration fixed\n- ✅ \"Round Trip\" renamed to \"Return\" with return date field\n- ✅ Multi-city and one-way already working\n- ✅ System checks updated\n- ✅ Project builds successfully\n\n**To verify everything works**: Start the backend server, then test all 5 system checks. They should all pass.\n","fullPath":"FIXES_COMPLETED.md","isBinary":false,"lastModified":1769624746674},"backend/middleware":{"name":"middleware","type":"folder","fullPath":"backend/middleware","lastModified":1769624746674},"public/airport.csv":{"name":"airport.csv","type":"file","contents":"ident,type,name,elevation_ft,continent,iso_country,iso_region,municipality,icao_code,iata_code,gps_code,local_code,coordinates\r\n00A,heliport,Total RF Heliport,11,NA,US,US-PA,Bensalem,,,K00A,00A,\"40.070985, -74.933689\"\r\n00AA,small_airport,Aero B Ranch Airport,3435,NA,US,US-KS,Leoti,,,00AA,00AA,\"38.704022, -101.473911\"\r\n00AK,small_airport,Lowell Field,450,NA,US,US-AK,Anchor Point,,,00AK,00AK,\"59.947733, -151.692524\"\r\n00AL,small_airport,Epps Airpark,820,NA,US,US-AL,Harvest,,,00AL,00AL,\"34.86479949951172, -86.77030181884766\"\r\n00AN,small_airport,Katmai Lodge Airport,80,NA,US,US-AK,King Salmon,,,00AN,00AN,\"59.093287, -156.456699\"\r\n00AS,small_airport,Fulton Airport,1100,NA,US,US-OK,Alex,,,00AS,00AS,\"34.9428028, -97.8180194\"\r\n00AZ,small_airport,Cordes Airport,3810,NA,US,US-AZ,Cordes,,,00AZ,00AZ,\"34.305599212646484, -112.16500091552734\"\r\n00CA,small_airport,Goldstone (GTS) Airport,3038,NA,US,US-CA,Barstow,,,00CA,00CA,\"35.35474, -116.885329\"\r\n00CL,small_airport,Williams Ag Airport,87,NA,US,US-CA,Biggs,,,00CL,00CL,\"39.427188, -121.763427\"\r\n00CN,heliport,Kitchen Creek Helibase Heliport,3350,NA,US,US-CA,Pine Valley,,,00CN,00CN,\"32.7273736, -116.4597417\"\r\n00FA,small_airport,Grass Patch Airport,53,NA,US,US-FL,Bushnell,,,00FA,00FA,\"28.64550018310547, -82.21900177001953\"\r\n00FL,small_airport,River Oak Airport,35,NA,US,US-FL,Okeechobee,,,00FL,00FL,\"27.230899810791016, -80.96920013427734\"\r\n00GA,small_airport,Lt World Airport,700,NA,US,US-GA,Lithonia,,,00GA,00GA,\"33.76750183105469, -84.